52V -> retained TPS7A3301 -> N12 -11.99675V. Conditional -300mA objective, NOT a rating.\nIC GND1 = NRAW. L1 returns to SYSTEM GND. EN/FB are referenced to NRAW, never EF_SHDN/BI_EN.\nU4, MID and dormant-positive/VREF/compensation network removed. U5 +5V and U14 positive boost remain independent." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "74275c68-b764-5e85-a237-ce164e17e1af")) (text "L1: Bourns SRP1245A-220M / C1848803,22uH. 5.0mm max body vs5.1mm allowance, only0.1mm BEFORE solder; NO fit approval.\nC89..92: four Basic2.2u50V C50254 span bypasses; conservative3.01uF screen, not8.8uF effective.\nSeven local22u25V C12891 output caps; separate five-cap U13 input bank. Kelvin NRAW to FB/EN and local IC bypass.\nR9+R15+R84=100k+120k precision +6.2k Basic; R10=10k precision. Upper not entirely0.1%.\n28V recommended VIN/SW span; eFuse OV threshold is NOT clamp. Start/stop, ringing, hot L, loop and reverse paths need bench tests.\nD30 A=NRAW/K=system GND: startup mitigation ONLY, no +0.3V guarantee. Measure U13 IN/NR/FB/OUT. C93 DNP, no selected CFF.\nSR2 SCHEMATIC REVIEW ONLY. Opus + DeepSeek -> corrections/recheck -> user view + explicit ACK -> separate PCB worker." (at 20.32 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e429b9a5-cbbc-5041-ad5a-942fd9b57d4d")) (wire (pts (xy 25.4 66.04) (xy 45.72 66.04)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "515d1762-33b0-5df3-9781-f16dee961586")) (wire (pts (xy 45.72 66.04) (xy 83.82 66.04)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "ee253bc7-a863-5749-887c-ce7563e07b65")) (wire (pts (xy 83.82 66.04) (xy 119.38 66.04)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "fa3fe91e-518a-5ba4-b24b-c54cb9d05a1e")) (wire (pts (xy 119.38 66.04) (xy 160.02 66.04)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "6d87f522-0e58-5c00-8143-6da995eb679e")) (wire (pts (xy 30.48 213.36) (xy 66.04 213.36)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "cf710ec4-c40e-5f04-981c-e7fbb447905f")) (wire (pts (xy 66.04 21